<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>二月種了多少朵花？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>五月種了多少朵花？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>三月比五月多幾朵？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>五個月總共種了多少朵花？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：從棒形圖提取和比較資訊<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>最多/最少：</strong>搵最高/最矮嘅棒 → 讀對應類別<br/>
② <strong>相差：</strong>兩條棒嘅高度差 = 兩者數量差<br/>
③ <strong>總和：</strong>所有棒嘅數值加埋<br/>
④ <strong>判斷：</strong>「邊個多過邊個？」「A 比 B 多幾多？」
</div></div>
